  m_text: "Kashi Vishwanath Temple is a Hindu temple dedicated to Shiva. It is located
    in Vishwanath Gali, in Varanasi, Uttar Pradesh, India. The temple is a Hindu
    pilgrimage site and is one of the twelve Jyotirlinga shrines. The presiding deity
    is known by the names Vishwanath and Vishweshwara (IAST: Vi\u015Bvan\u0101tha
    and Vi\u015Bve\u015Bvara), meaning Lord of the Universe. Kashi is considered
    one of the world's oldest continuously inhabited cities and a significant pilgrimage
    site for Hindus"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
