  m_text: "The Taj-ul-Masajid also known as the T\u0101j-ul-Masjid  is a Sunni mosque,
    affiliated with Tablighi Jamaat, part of the Deobandi movement, located in Bhopal,
    in the state of Madhya Pradesh, India. With capacity for c.\u2009175,000 worshippers,
    it is the largest mosque in India and, as of 2014, was the ninth largest mosque
    in the world."
