  m_text: "The Mahabodhi Temple (literally: \"Great Awakening Temple\") or the Mah\u0101bodhi
    Mah\u0101vih\u0101ra, a UNESCO World Heritage Site, is an ancient, but restored
    Buddhist temple in Bodh Gaya, Bihar, India, marking the location where the Buddha
    is said to have attained enlightenment"
